#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rc-calibration.rst:5
#: c8d86ebe28804f79b1a186d7404453f9
msgid "Traditional Helicopter — RC Calibration"
msgstr "传统直升机 — 遥控校准"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rc-calibration.rst:7
#: bf89f238883446d9bf8bd99295b44dde
msgid ""
"This page covers specific details about calibrating the RC controller for a "
"helicopter."
msgstr "本页面介绍有关直升机遥控控制器校准的具体细节。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rc-calibration.rst:11
#: 612a4a0b233f425089a50898f89009f3
msgid ""
"Before powering the autopilot and servo rail for the first time, disconnect "
"the rudder linkage from the tail servo or bellcrank on the tail gearbox. If "
"you have a piston engine helicopter, also disconnect the throttle servo "
"linkage."
msgstr "在首次为飞控和舵机轨道上电之前，请断开方向舵连杆与尾翼舵机或尾减速箱上摇臂的连接。如果您有活塞发动机直升机，还需断开油门舵机连杆。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rc-calibration.rst:16
#: c959c58221e74f44857454fa455bd019
msgid ""
"The RC MUST be calibrated before proceeding once the autopilot is powered "
"up. RC calibration is identical to all other vehicles. With helicopters "
"using the ArduPilot system there can be no mixes in the RC radio. All the "
"outputs must be \"pure\", i.e. use either airplane mode in your radio, or "
"helicopter mode with H1 or \"straight\" swash. :ref:`General Radio Control "
"Calibration Wiki <common-radio-control-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"飞控上电后，必须先校准遥控才能继续。遥控校准与所有其他飞行器相同。使用 ArduPilot "
"系统的直升机在遥控电台中不能有任何混控。所有输出必须是\"纯\"的，即在您的遥控器中使用固定翼模式，或带有 H1 "
"或\"直通\"斜盘的直升机模式。:ref:`通用遥控校准 Wiki <common-radio-control-calibration>`。"
